Z||000001||theogre||02-08-2001||07:37 PM||||it won't work.<P>Fiero columns are nothing special. go to the local salvage yards. you can get one there cheap off any number of GM cars.<P>read the steering column article in my cave before disassebling a column in an automatic. <A HREF="http://fierocave.shorturl.com" TARGET=_blank>The Ogre's Fiero Cave</A>||||reg||1
